@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2

title Sequence-диаграмма: Django Web-приложение (app/)

actor "Пользователь" as User
participant "Браузер\n(panel.html)" as Browser
box "Django Application (app/)" #LightYellow
  participant "URL Router\n(app/urls.py)" as Router
  participant "Views\n(admin_panel + auditor_panel)" as Views
  participant "Serializers\n(admin_panel/serializer.py)" as Serializer
  database "Models\n(auditor_panel/models.py)" as Model
  database "SQLite\n(db.sqlite3)" as DB
end box

== Просмотр панели (Dashboard) ==
User -> Browser : GET /
Browser -> Router : GET /
Router -> Views : PanelView.as_view()\n(ListView, model=IpPool)
Views -> Model : IpPool.objects.all()
Model -> DB : SELECT * FROM auditor_panel_ippool
DB --> Model : QuerySet
Model --> Views : ip_pools
Views --> Browser : render(panel.html, {ip_pools})
Browser --> User : Страница с таблицей IP-пулов\n+ кнопки "Run"

== CRUD: Список IP-пулов ==
User -> Browser : GET /panel/auditor/
Browser -> Router : GET /panel/auditor/
Router -> Views : IpPoolRead.as_view()\n(ListView, paginate_by=20)
Views -> Model : IpPool.objects.all()
Model -> DB : SELECT с пагинацией
DB --> Model : QuerySet (20 записей)
Model --> Views : ip_pools
Views --> Browser : render(ippool_list.html)
Browser --> User : Таблица IP-пулов с пагинацией

== CRUD: Создание IP-пула ==
User -> Browser : GET /panel/auditor/create
Browser -> Router : GET /panel/auditor/create
Router -> Views : IpPoolCreate.as_view()\n(IpPoolBaseView + CreateView)
Views --> Browser : render(ippool_form.html)\nФорма: ip, mask, description, ports
Browser --> User : Форма создания

User -> Browser : POST /panel/auditor/create\n{ip, mask, description, ports}
Browser -> Router : POST /panel/auditor/create
Router -> Views : IpPoolCreate (обработка формы)
Views -> Model : IpPool.objects.create(data)
Model -> DB : INSERT INTO auditor_panel_ippool
DB --> Model : OK
Model --> Views : IpPool instance
Views --> Browser : redirect /panel/auditor/ (success_url)
Browser -> Router : GET /panel/auditor/
Router --> Browser : Обновлённый список
Browser --> User : Список с новым IP-пулом

== CRUD: Детали / Обновление / Удаление ==
User -> Browser : GET /panel/auditor/<id>
Browser -> Router : GET /panel/auditor/<id>
Router -> Views : IpPoolDetail.as_view()\n(DetailView, pk_url_kwarg='id')
Views -> Model : IpPool.objects.get(pk=id)
Model -> DB : SELECT WHERE id=<id>
DB --> Model : IpPool instance
Model --> Views : ip_pool
Views --> Browser : render(ippool_detail.html)\nКнопки Edit / Delete

User -> Browser : POST /panel/auditor/<id>/update
Browser -> Router : POST /panel/auditor/<id>/update
Router -> Views : IpPoolUpdate.as_view()\n(IpPoolBaseView + UpdateView)
Views -> Model : instance.save()
Model -> DB : UPDATE auditor_panel_ippool
DB --> Model : OK
Model --> Views : instance
Views --> Browser : redirect /panel/auditor/

User -> Browser : POST /panel/auditor/<id>/delete
Browser -> Router : POST /panel/auditor/<id>/delete
Router -> Views : IpPoolDelete.as_view()\n(DeleteView, success_url="auditor")
Views -> Model : instance.delete()
Model -> DB : DELETE FROM auditor_panel_ippool
DB --> Model : OK
Model --> Views : OK
Views --> Browser : redirect /panel/auditor/

== Запуск сканирования (API) ==
User -> Browser : Нажимает "Run" для IP-пула
Browser -> Browser : fetch('/start_connection', {\n  method: 'POST',\n  body: JSON.stringify(ip_data)\n})
Browser -> Router : POST /start_connection
Router -> Views : IpRun.as_view() (APIView)
Views -> Serializer : IpSerializer(data=request.data)
Serializer -> Model : Валидация полей IpPool
Model --> Serializer : valid / invalid
alt Данные валидны
  Serializer --> Views : validated_data
  Views --> Browser : 201 Created (JSON)
else Данные невалидны
  Serializer --> Views : errors
  Views --> Browser : 400 Bad Request (errors)
end

note over Browser, Views
  **ВАЖНО**: IpRun.post() только валидирует и возвращает данные.
  Фактическая отправка в Redis/агенты НЕ реализована.
  send_data_to_api() в coordinator_core — заглушка (pass).
end note

@enduml
